  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tamasuk - Supporting resilience, social cohesion and inclusion of populations facing climate change and forced displacement in Mauritania (UNHCR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote beneficiary inclusion into the national system by strengthening the resilience and community capacity of forcibly displaced refugees and host communities in Hodh Chargui region, Mauritania&#xae09;&#xaca9;&#xd788; &#xc720;&#xc785;&#xb418;&#xb294; &#xb09c;&#xbbfc;&#xc758; &#xbb34;&#xbd84;&#xbcc4;&#xd55c; &#xc815;&#xcc29; &#xbc29;&#xc9c0;, &#xb09c;&#xbbfc; &#xb4f1;&#xb85d; &#xbc0f; &#xc548;&#xc815;&#xc801;&#xc778; &#xc815;&#xcc29; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0; &#xb4f1; &#xb09c;&#xbbfc; &#xb300;&#xc0c1; &#xd1b5;&#xd569;&#xc801; &#xc815;&#xcc29; &#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c; &#xac1c;&#xc120; &#xbc0f; &#xacbd;&#xc81c;&#xc801; &#xae30;&#xd68c; &#xd655;&#xb300;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote peaceful coexisence between refugees and host communities through participatory community projects, and support green income generting activities to support economic indepence of beneficiaries, thereby enhancing access to basic social services through enhancing local government&apos;s capacities.</narrative>
  </description>
